<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets 500 mln mark 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets 500 mln mark 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.725   PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.55     SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   2.175</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
